IN THAT WEIGHT ROOM.

338
00:15:11,811 --> 00:15:13,480
LET'S GO!
ON THE BALL!

339
00:15:15,248 --> 00:15:17,217
ALL RIGHT, MAN,
I'M OUTTA HERE, BRO.

340
00:15:17,250 --> 00:15:19,552
