LET'S GO. LET'S GO.

399
00:17:39,659 --> 00:17:41,561
Team: 1, 2, 3, GO!

400
00:17:43,296 --> 00:17:46,366
Man on P.A.: NUNEZ,
NUMBER 32, ON THE FIELD.

401
00:17:46,399 --> 00:17:48,301
NUNEZ WITH THE BALL.

402
00:17:51,638 --> 00:17:53,340
UNH!

403
00:17:54,474 --> 00:17:56,409
