YOU'VE GOT MORGAN NOW

2003
01:29:30,433 --> 01:29:34,369
AND YOU'RE GONNA DO IT
RIGHT THIS TIME.

2004
01:29:37,473 --> 01:29:39,608
I JUST WISH
I WASN'T THE CHILD

2005
01:29:39,642 --> 01:29:42,678
THAT EVERYBODY LEARNED
WHAT NOT TO DO FROM.

2006
01:29:42,711 --> 01:29:44,780
THAT'S NOT WHO YOU ARE.

2007
