2042
01:31:35,824 --> 01:31:40,696
NICOLE, I JUST DON'T THINK
I CAN LIVE WITH YOU.

2043
01:31:42,665 --> 01:31:45,167
I KNOW I CAN'T LIVE
WITHOUT HER.

2044
01:31:54,509 --> 01:31:56,979
WE HAVE TO BE AT PEPPERDINE
IN 10 MINUTES, TOM.

2045
